          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.571,
            0.774,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. How would you distinguish experimentally between an alcohol and a carboxylic acid?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.608,
            0.389,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. What are oxidising agents?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
